{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Welcome Back to University</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new semester. New faces. New rules. And new ways to get into trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/ec150fe048bc0d9a0093e8d1be33fbf4.poster.avif?t=1758468597\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/ec150fe048bc0d9a0093e8d1be33fbf4.webm?t=1758468597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/ec150fe048bc0d9a0093e8d1be33fbf4.mp4?t=1758468597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>University Days \u2013 Semester 2</i> is a choice-driven visual novel where you navigate the complex world of university politics, manipulative faculty, and emotionally charged relationships. This complete season features upgraded systems, expanded content, and decisions that fundamentally change how your story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch with multiple episodes available immediately, with all 18 episodes of Semester 2 delivered as free updates throughout Early Access \u2013 no additional purchases required.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just here to attend class. You're here to outwit scheming professors, survive volatile roommate dynamics, and navigate power games that could reshape your entire university experience. Whether you're continuing from Season 1 or jumping in fresh, this semester delivers a complete narrative experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into university life with branching storylines covering romance, friendship, academic pressure, and campus politics. Multiple story paths and relationship dynamics encourage repeat playthroughs to discover all possible outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This semester, your choices matter more than ever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/6c31ae16d919bad01885fd562e2d3f99.poster.avif?t=1758468597\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/6c31ae16d919bad01885fd562e2d3f99.webm?t=1758468597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/6c31ae16d919bad01885fd562e2d3f99.mp4?t=1758468597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 New Erotic Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more explicit, story-rich NSFW scenes featuring returning favorites and bold new characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf1 Interactive Phone System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts, check social media, and snap in-game photos. The phone is your window into secrets, flirts, and hidden moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f The Mystery of \u2018X\u2019 Deepens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voyeuristic puppet master is watching your every move. New clues emerge \u2014 but so do new threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfeb New Classes &amp; Teachers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the bold Miss Varela and the icy Miss Cross \u2014 but be careful what you reveal. Every teacher has an agenda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Expanded Choice System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More decisions with lasting consequences. Your relationships and reputation are now even more reactive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8b Bonus Scenes &amp; Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen fully illustrated bonus scenes \u2014 including standalone fantasies and alternate dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Now in 6 Additional Languages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully translated into French, Spanish, German, Russian, Chinese (Simplified), and Turkish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3b48c88f11166971da3037f32ca17bad.poster.avif?t=1758468597\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3b48c88f11166971da3037f32ca17bad.webm?t=1758468597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/extras/3b48c88f11166971da3037f32ca17bad.mp4?t=1758468597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403700?t=1758468597","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403700?t=1758468597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403700/78b5a666d0270fe460ee5eba73a58972978f0383/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758468597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.stea